本的基本对象类型。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ubff337e3\" id=\"ubff337e3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7482cb4a\" id=\"u7482cb4a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">创建Label对象:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22lv_obj_t%20*%20lv_label_create(lv_obj_t%20*%20parent)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sComW%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><blockquote data-lake-id=\"uda337820\" id=\"uda337820\"><p data-lake-id=\"u769fa584\" id=\"u769fa584\"><span data-lake-id=\"u12b3cd45\" id=\"u12b3cd45\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">参数可以指定</span><code data-lake-id=\"u799b4f4c\" id=\"u799b4f4c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucdf222bc\" id=\"ucdf222bc\">lv_scr_act()</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u0b52f1da\" id=\"u0b52f1da\">会自动显示在图层上</span></p></blockquote><p data-lake-id=\"uf9815cc8\" id=\"uf9815cc8\"><span data-lake-id=\"udb30b8fd\" id=\"udb30b8fd\">设置文本内容:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22void%20lv_label_set_text(lv_obj_t%20*%20obj%2C%20const%20char%20*%20text)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22huAyo%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uce57ccd0\"