eToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ocdqN%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ued3c1fd1\" id=\"ued3c1fd1\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue38ccc0b\" id=\"ue38ccc0b\">如果我们想用这些字体的话,只需要在样式中指定这些宏定义的小写格式就可以了. </span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22lv_style_set_text_font(%26style1%2C%26lv_font_montserrat_48)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lrM0N%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ua2412483\" id=\"ua2412483\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc454081a\" id=\"uc454081a\">由于lvgl自带的库不支持中文, 若想显示中文,我们就需要创建自己的字体库.  按照如下3个步骤,我们可以快速创建自己的字体库</span></p><ol list=\"uaa040821\"><li fid=\"u0060cf60\" data-lake-id=\"uc55016d3\" id=\"uc55016d3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u20fbadda\" id=\"u20fbadda\">准备好字体库 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u7cd08904\" id=\"u7cd08904\"><span data-lake-id=\"u54031eb2\" id=\"u54031eb2\">.ttf</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"udd08f6c8\" id=\"udd08f6c8\"> 或者</span><code data-lake-id=\"ub5ab9578\" id=\"ub5ab9578\"><span data-lake-id=\"u70ce0f27\" id=\"u70ce0f27\">.woff</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u8eee9450\" id=\"u8eee9450\">格式的字体(这个可以从网上找到)</span></li><li fid=\"u0060cf60\" data-lake-id=\"u654698f0\" id=\"u654698f0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u33e070d7\" id=\"u33e070d7\">打开网站</span><a href=\"https://lvgl.io/tools/fontconverter\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u5ad9b807\" id=\"u5ad9b807\"><span data-lake-id=\"u94fcc8bf\" id=\"u94fcc8bf\">https://lvgl.io/tools/fontconverter</span></a></li><li fid=\"u0060cf60\" data-lake-id=\"u7d827e00\" id=\"u7d827e00\"><span data-lake-id=\"uda18fea6\" id=\"uda18fea6\">按照如下图进行配置并导出</span></li><li fid=\"u0060cf60\" data-lake-id=\"ue7b64176\" id=\"ue7b64176\"><span data-lake-id=\"u43d6befe\" id=\"u43d6befe\">文字：&quot;</span><code data-lake-id=\"u5cbeac25\" id=\"u5cbeac25\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub8a80de9\" id=\"ub8a80de9\">我在黑马学习嵌入式/集成电路，。！？我太想睡觉了只有学习才能使我快乐</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u95942dea\" id=\"u95942dea\">&quot;</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u98b1cf3a\" id=\"u98b1cf3a\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1693844778246-c4d9dce6-13db-4d86-8eaf-c77680325a11.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ubfe56952-321f-40c9-8d27-c6c2d33209a%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u961a7563-ef62-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A893.6363442673176%2C%22height%22%3A735%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A78876%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A983%2C%22originHeight%22%3A809%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.100000023841858%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22TRYTOUSEGLYPHCOLORINFOFROMFONTTOCREATEGRAYSCALEICONS.%22%2C%22x%22%3A50%2C%22y%22%3A258%2C%22width%22%3A694%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HORIZONTALSUBPIXELRENDERING(MAYIMPROVEFONTQUALITYBUTRESULTSINLARGERFONTS%22%2C%22x%22%3A52%2C%22y%22%3A232%2C%22width%22%3A777%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RANGESAND%2FORCHARACTERSTOINCLUDE.E.G.0X20-0X7F%2C0X200%2C450%22%2C%22x%22%3A214%2C%22y%22%3A431%2C%22width%22%3A588%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%88%91%E5%9C%A8%E9%BB%91%E9%A9%AC%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%E5%B5%8C%E5%85%A5%E5%BC%8F%2F%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E7%94%B5%E8%B7%AF%2C%E6%88%91%E5%A4%AA%E6%83%B3%E7%9D%A1%E8%A7%89%E4%BA%86%E5%8F%AA%E6%